  rl.2 Russell McKinney|absent husband|Left a note in 1992 and did not return; present whereabouts unconfirmed.
  rl.3 Pearl Adkins|quilting friend|Led the circle and lent Laurel money after the household bills consumed her savings.
  rl.4 Vernon Pike|father, died 1989|Taught her to fish from low banks and let her draw rather than answer hurried questions.
end

